	// Instance admin. Runs the housekeeping the leader runs daily and returns what
	// it deleted. Never deletes a version's current SBOM snapshots, a finding's last
	// scan, the latest scan of a scan target, or a project's default version.
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /retention/run (the `RunRetention` operationId).
