	// GetSbomDiff What changed between two snapshots
	//
	// Packages added, removed, upgraded, downgraded or changed (several
	// versions, or versions that don't order) since `base` — by default the
	// previous snapshot of the same artifact — each with the vulnerabilities
	// the change fixed or introduced. A package is matched across versions by
	// its purl without version (or type/group/name). `services` lists the
	// declared services added, removed or changed (version, endpoints,
	// authentication, trust boundary/zone, data classifications), matched by
	// group/name. `base` must belong to the same project.
