	// services carry their parent's bom-ref in `parent_ref` — with endpoints,
	// authentication, trust boundary (`x-trust-boundary`) / zone (`trustZone`)
	// and data flows (≤1.4 `{flow, classification}` and the 1.5+ serviceData
	// shape alike). Each service is flagged `unauthenticated_external`
	// (authenticated is false and an endpoint is http(s)) and
	// `crosses_trust_boundary` (x-trust-boundary is true, or a data flow's
	// source/destination resolves to a service of the snapshot in another trust
	// zone). SPDX documents have no services.
