// returns a short-lived bearer token (`FEDERATION_TOKEN_TTL`, ≤ 1h) for the
// bound service account. Refusals are `401` with `error: invalid_grant`.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
//
// Corresponds with POST /auth/token (the `ExchangeToken` operationId).
