// UpdateFindingWithBody Triage a finding
//
// Set the lifecycle state. Triage is **sticky**: a finding you marked
// `false_positive` stays that way when the next scan reports it again — that's
// the whole point. `remediated`, by contrast, is what the system sets itself
// when a scanner stops reporting an issue.
//
// Give an exception state an `expires_at` and it reopens automatically when
// the acceptance lapses.
//
// With `ASSESSMENT_REQUIRES_APPROVAL=true` a status change is not applied:
// it's recorded as a pending assessment (202) that a project owner or instance
