// CreateSsoGroupMappingWithBody Map an IdP group to a role
//
// Instance admin only. Members of `group` get the role on their **next SSO
// login** through a provider in the mapping's scope, and lose it at the
// first such login after they leave the group (or the mapping is deleted).
// The sync only adds, changes and removes the grants it made itself
// (`source: sso`); a manual grant on the same target is never touched, and
// the instance owner is never demoted. Existing sessions keep working until
