// ApplyTriageRules Apply the rules to the existing backlog
//
// New rules take effect on the next ingest automatically. This applies them to
// findings that are already there — what you call after writing a rule.
// Regroups cross-tool duplicates afterwards, since a rule can change a
// severity and severity decides which tool's report leads a group. Only
// enabled, approved rules apply; each rule's `hit_count` grows by the findings
