// TransferOwnership Hand the instance owner role to another user
//
// **Only the current owner may call this** — being an admin is not enough,
// which is the entire point of having an owner.
//
// The instance has exactly one owner: always an admin, and no one can demote
// or remove them. Without it, every admin can demote every other admin,
// including whoever set the instance up, and one careless or compromised admin
// account can lock everyone else out.
//
// The recipient becomes owner and admin atomically. The previous owner stays
// an admin — a transfer is not a demotion — but is now protected no longer.
//
