	// ListFeedRulesWithResponse Advisory feed rules
	//
	// Instance admin. Rules over the incoming advisory feed, applied inside the matcher
	// after every source answered and before matches become findings — so every source
	// (online, mirror, private, CPE) is subject to them. In `position` order, then oldest
	// first: any matching `mute` drops the advisory for that package (its finding closes on
	// the next healthy run; a partial run never closes anything); the first matching
	// `set_severity` decides the severity; every matching `add_tags` adds its tags. Acting
	// rules are recorded in the finding's `metadata.feed_rules`.
