	// The rule that removes most of a dependency backlog is
	// `{"dep_scope": "dev", "action": "false_positive"}` — suppress
	// vulnerabilities in dependencies that never ship. A finding with no SBOM data
	// matches neither `dep_scope` nor `dep_transitive`: unknown is never
	// auto-suppressed. Likewise a finding with no EPSS score never matches `min_epss`.
	//
	// With `TRIAGE_RULES_REQUIRE_APPROVAL=true` the rule is created `pending` and
	// does nothing until a different admin approves it.
