// who can reach it — grants on a parent reach every descendant — so it
// needs owner on the project and on the new parent. The parent must be in
// the same organization; a cycle (**400**) or a tree deeper than 5 levels
// (**400**) is refused. A project with scans or SBOMs cannot become a
// collection (**409**).
